```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Browser)
    participant FE as Next.js Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI /api/analyze-email
    participant ORC as Orchestrator
    participant P as EmailParserAgent
    participant Q as LeadQualificationAgent
    participant R as CompanyResearchAgent
    participant S as BuyingSignalAgent
    participant CS as CaseStudyMatchingAgent
    participant G as GTMRecommendationAgent
    participant O as OutreachAgent
    participant H as AEHandoffAgent
    participant LLM as LLM Provider (OpenAI/Gemini)
    participant WEB as Tavily Search API

    U->>FE: Paste email, click "Analyze"
    FE->>API: POST /api/analyze-email {email_text}
    API->>ORC: run_full_pipeline(email_text)

    ORC->>P: run(email_text)
    P->>LLM: system_prompt + email_text
    LLM-->>P: ParsedEmail JSON
    P-->>ORC: ParsedEmail

    ORC->>Q: run(parsed_email)
    Q->>LLM: MEDDPICC prompt
    LLM-->>Q: QualificationResult JSON
    Q-->>ORC: QualificationResult

    ORC->>R: run(parsed_email)
    R->>WEB: research_company(name, industry)
    WEB-->>R: search snippets
    R->>LLM: synthesis prompt + snippets
    LLM-->>R: CompanyResearch JSON
    R-->>ORC: CompanyResearch

    ORC->>S: run(parsed_email, research)
    S->>LLM: signal-detection prompt
    LLM-->>S: BuyingSignalResult JSON
    S-->>ORC: BuyingSignalResult

    ORC->>CS: run(parsed_email, research)
    CS->>LLM: match against case_studies.py library
    LLM-->>CS: CaseStudyResult JSON
    CS-->>ORC: CaseStudyResult

    ORC->>G: run(parsed_email, research, qualification, signals)
    G->>LLM: GTM routing prompt
    LLM-->>G: GTMRecommendation JSON
    G-->>ORC: GTMRecommendation

    ORC->>O: run(parsed_email, research, qualification, case_study)
    O->>LLM: outreach generation prompt
    LLM-->>O: OutreachPackage JSON
    O-->>ORC: OutreachPackage

    ORC->>H: run(all upstream results)
    H->>LLM: CRM handoff synthesis prompt
    LLM-->>H: AEHandoffSummary JSON
    H-->>ORC: AEHandoffSummary

    ORC-->>API: FullAnalysisResult
    API-->>FE: 200 OK, FullAnalysisResult JSON
    FE-->>U: Renders 7 dashboard cards
```
